0 ls0 ws0">是从根节点到该节点的路径长度。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h7 y19b ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">两路合并的最佳合并模式：</div><div class="t m0 xa1 h7 y19c ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _16"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">设<span class="_ _f"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑊<span class="_ _1c"> </span><span class="ff9">=<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffb">{<span class="_ _d"></span></span></span>𝑤</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xc0 h14 y19d ffe fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1</div><div class="t m0 x26 h15 y19c ff8 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">,<span class="_ _20"> </span>𝑤</div><div class="t m0 x28 h14 y19d ffe fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2</div><div class="t m0 xb7 h15 y19c ff8 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">,<span class="_ _20"> </span>.<span class="_ _20"> </span>.<span class="_ _f"> </span>.<span class="_ _20"> </span>,<span class="_ _20"> </span>𝑤</div><div class="t m0 x55 h12 y19d ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑛</div><div class="t m0 x2b h7 y19c ffb fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">}<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">为权值集合，以每个权值为根节点值，构造<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑛<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>棵只有根节点的二叉树。</span></div><div class="t m0 xa1 h7 y19e ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _16"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">取出权值最小的两棵树，作为左右子树构造新二叉树，新二叉树的根节点值为子树的根节点值之和。</span></div><div class="t m0 xa1 h7 y19f ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _16"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">重复步骤<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">2</span>，直到只剩下最后一棵树。</span></div><div class="t m0 x10 h10 y1a0 ff6 fs5 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.3.1<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐾<span class="_ _1c"> </span><span class="ff1">路合并</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h7 y1a1 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">令<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑛<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>为权值个数，当<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑛<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffb">−<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffe">1<span class="_ _c"> </span></span></span></span>不是<span class="_ _c"> </span